cutar Antigravity Agent:\', error);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nif (require.main === module) {\\n  runAntigravityAgent();\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/scripts/antigravity-runner.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating scripts/antigravity-runner.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create runner script for Antigravity Agent\"}"
