  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":1,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:35:46Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nBuild me an app with screens that look like this. You can hotlink images from the html\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-05T16:35:46-07:00.\\n\\nThe user has uploaded 4 image(s):\\n- Image 1.png\\n- Image 3.png\\n- Image 5.png\\n- Image 7.png\\nYou can embed these images in an artifact if you need the USER to review them.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-mzf4vzryjdniowjsdw2hma-1472116662.us-east5.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-mzf4vzryjdniowjsdw2hma-1472116662.us-east5.run.app\\nUser Email: mpbombillo@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"media\":[{\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"uri\":\"Image 1.png\"},{\"mime_type\":\"text/html\",\"uri\":\"Image 2.html\"},{\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"uri\":\"Image 3.png\"},{\"mime_type\":\"text/html\",\"uri\":\"Image 4.html\"},{\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"uri\":\"Image 5.png\"},{\"mime_type\":\"text/html\",\"uri\":\"Image 6.html\"},{\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"uri\":\"Image 7.png\"},{\"mime_type\":\"text/html\",\"uri\":\"Image 8.html\"},{\"mime_type\":\"text/markdown\",\"uri\":\"Image 9.markdown\"}]}\n{\"step_index\":2,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:35:54Z\",\"input_tokens\":90356,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":1392,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Input**\\n\\nI\'m currently digesting the user\'s request. I understand they want an app with specific screen designs, and they\'ve provided image examples. I\'m focusing on hotlinking images from HTML as a viable design approach. I\'m starting to visualize the app\'s structure based on the provided images.\\n\\n\\n**Integrating New Requirements**\\n\\nI\'ve got a clearer picture of the app\'s components, including Fisiopatolog\303\255a, Curvas Kraft, and the calculator screen. The latest development includes incorpora\\n<truncated 847 bytes>\\n is for a standard CDSS app based on specific screens. However, I now have a new set of instructions, \\\"la app debe usar colores modernos, debe ser un juego llamativo, inicialmente vamos a realizar 10 niveles , lo cuales se iran incrementa el nivel de complejidad.\\\" My current thinking is to include *both*: the complete CDSS app as originally designed *and* a separate, engaging gamified \\\"Clinical Simulator\\\" mode with 10 increasing levels. I\'m focusing on elegantly integrating these two distinct components.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing frontend design skill\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View frontend design skill\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":4,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":11905,\"cache_read_tokens\":90332,\"output_tokens\":115,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/8_science_space_biotech.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing science biotech reference\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View biotech domain reference\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":6,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":6189,\"cache_read_tokens\":98528,\"output_tokens\":1395,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the User\'s Request**\\n\\nI\'m starting to break down the user\'s request. It seems they want an app with specific screen designs, potentially pulling images directly from HTML. I\'m focusing on the implied need for modern color palettes, too. Now I am trying to determine what a good strategy is for this app, and to think about the best approach.\\n\\n\\n**Defining the Application\'s Scope**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the application\'s core functionality. The initial focus will be on 10 levels of increasing compl\\n<truncated 906 bytes>\\nts integration within the app. I\'m focusing on the Metabolic Risk Stratum timeline, from Estrato 0 to 3, and the SHAP Risk Predictors (XGBoost Fenotipador). I have planned the attribution bars, directives for immediate action, biochemical countermeasures, and safety guidelines. I\'m also planning the cellular research visual panels. I\'m also analyzing the clinical plan commit bar. Furthermore, I\'ve started organizing the \\\"Matriz Terap\303\251utica\\\" and \\\"Monitoreo y FHIR\\\" tabs, which will be added to navigation.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src files\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List src directory\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":8,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:18Z\",\"input_tokens\":3609,\"cache_read_tokens\":103045,\"output_tokens\":66,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View metadata.json\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":10,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":3918,\"cache_read_tokens\":103033,\"output_tokens\":48,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/index.html\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing index.html\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View index.html\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":12,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":4402,\"cache_read_tokens\":103021,\"output_tokens\":260,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Font Implementations**\\n\\nI\'m currently investigating the project\'s font integration by examining `src/index.css` and `package.json` for font or icon declarations. I\'m focusing on identifying how fonts are being incorporated, especially in light of the HTML\'s Google Fonts usage. My objective is to confirm the presence and method of font implementation.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View src/index.css\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":14,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":4862,\"cache_read_tokens\":103081,\"output_tokens\":961,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Tailwind Implementation**\\n\\nI\'ve observed the use of `@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.3.3`, indicating Tailwind v4. This version allows me to define custom theme colors and font families within `src/index.css` using the `@theme` directive, or standard CSS variables. This directly aligns with the design system specifications I\'m considering.\\n\\n\\n**Defining Color Variables**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on defining the color variables. I\'ve compiled a list including primary, secondary, tertiary, and various surface shades, each with corresponding container, on, and variant colors. This extensive list ensures comprehensive coverage for consistent theming. This includes a multitude of color shades, and this initial phase lays the groundwork for creating a cohesive and visually pleasing design system.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Set app name and description in metadata.json\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"EndoMetabolic Rx - CDSS & Medicina Funcional\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Sistema de soporte para decisiones cl\303\255nicas en medicina funcional: an\303\241lisis ATM, c\303\241lculo de \303\255ndices subrogados, curvas Kraft OGTT, estratificaci\303\263n metab\303\263lica inte\\n<truncated 174 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"requestFramePermissions\\\\\\\": [],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"majorCapabilities\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\\\\\\\"]\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update metadata.json with app name and description\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":16,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":6130,\"cache_read_tokens\":103215,\"output_tokens\":785,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update index.html title, meta tags, and font links\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"<!doctype html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\\\\\"es\\\\\\\">\\\\n  <head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\\\\\"UTF-8\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <title>EndoMetabolic Rx - CDSS & Medicina Funcional</title>\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\n<truncated 1379 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"<!doctype html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\">\\\\n  <head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\\\\\"UTF-8\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"An applic\\n<truncated 464 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/index.html\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating index.html\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Sync index.html title and fonts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":18,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:38Z\",\"input_tokens\":3558,\"cache_read_tokens\":107321,\"output_tokens\":1991,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Image Resources**\\n\\nI\'ve begun examining the images within the provided HTML templates. Right now, I\'m focusing specifically on the logo, which I\'ve isolated for detailed review.\\n\\n\\n**Examining Image Content**\\n\\nI am now closely examining the image content to classify each one based on its subject matter. I\'ve got a portrait, microscopy, and an ultrasound/histology image to consider. I am thinking of a taxonomy to apply to the resources.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Configure index.css with theme variables, typography, and utility classes\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"@import \\\\\\\"tailwindcss\\\\\\\";\\\\n\\\\n@layer base {\\\\n  :root {\\\\n    --primary: #005c55;\\\\n    --primary-container: #0f766e;\\\\n    --on-primary: #ffffff;\\\\n    --on-primary-container: #a3faef;\\\\n    --secondary: #904d00;\\\\n    --secondary-container: #fe932c;\\\\n    --secon\\n<truncated 1832 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"@import \\\\\\\"tailwindcss\\\\\\\";\\\\n\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Configure theme in index.css\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":20,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:36:47Z\",\"input_tokens\":6598,\"cache_read_tokens\":107383,\"output_tokens\":4545,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Application Requirements**\\n\\nI\'ve been analyzing the application\'s required screens and features to ensure a state-of-the-art design. Key elements include a header with the logo, title (\\\"EndoMetabolic Rx\\\"), and a subtitle (\\\"SISTEMA DE SOPORTE PARA DECISIONES CL\303\215NICAS EN MEDICINA FUNCIONAL\\\"). There will also be a clinical toggle option: \\\"Modo\\\".\\n\\n\\n**Defining Gamified Challenge Mode**\\n\\nI\'m now deep-diving into the \\\"Desaf\303\255o Cl\303\255nico\\\" (Clinical Challenge) mode. This 10-level gamified section will be\\n<truncated 5137 bytes>\\nlements**\\n\\nI\'m now focused on organizing the codebase for a clean architecture. I\'m establishing comprehensive TypeScript interfaces for key data structures. This includes types for patients, lab biomarkers, surrogate calculations, Kraft patterns, ATM matrix, CDSS recommendations, FHIR resources, and the 10 game levels. I\'m also creating specific files for patient data (like Eleanor Vance) and game level data, including medical cases and questions. Finally, I am including utils for metabolic calculators.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"export type ScreenTab =\\\\n  | \'pathophysiology-atm\'\\\\n  | \'surrogate-indices\'\\\\n  | \'kraft-ogtt-curves\'\\\\n  | \'cdss-stratification\'\\\\n  | \'therapeutics-matrix\'\\\\n  | \'monitoring-fhir\'\\\\n  | \'clinical-game\';\\\\n\\\\nexport type KraftPatternId =\\\\n  | \'pattern-1\'\\\\n  | \'\\n<truncated 2491 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/types.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating types.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create types for clinical decision support\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":22,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:37:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":7223,\"cache_read_tokens\":112702,\"output_tokens\":6260,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import { PatientLabs, SurrogateResults } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\nexport function calculateSurrogates(labs: PatientLabs): SurrogateResults {\\\\n  const { glucoseFasting, insulinFasting, triglycerides, hdl, bmi, waistCm, ggt, sex } = labs;\\\\n\\\\n  // 1. HOMA-IR: (Gl\\n<truncated 11648 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/utils/metabolicCalculators.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating metabolic calculators\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create metabolic formulas and Kraft data map\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":24,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:37:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":9520,\"cache_read_tokens\":116755,\"output_tokens\":2838,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import { MatrixNodeDetail, PatientLabs } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\nexport const ELEANOR_VANCE_LABS: PatientLabs = {\\\\n  glucoseFasting: 98,\\\\n  insulinFasting: 14.8,\\\\n  triglycerides: 172,\\\\n  hdl: 41,\\\\n  bmi: 28.4,\\\\n  waistCm: 89,\\\\n  ggt: 34,\\\\n  sex: \'female\',\\\\n}\\n<truncated 8146 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/data/patientData.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating patientData.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create patient profile and ATM matrix nodes data\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":26,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:37:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":4168,\"cache_read_tokens\":125033,\"output_tokens\":7035,\"thinking\":\"**Creating Game Levels Data**\\n\\nI\'m now implementing the 10 progressive clinical challenge levels within `src/data/gameLevelsData.ts`. Following the user\'s prompt, I\'m focusing on creating an appealing game, with modern colors and increasing complexity across the ten levels. The goal is to design an engaging progression.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import { GameLevel } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\nexport const GAME_LEVELS: GameLevel[] = [\\\\n  {\\\\n    id: 1,\\\\n    levelNumber: 1,\\\\n    title: \'Fricci\303\263n Subcl\303\255nica Temprana\',\\\\n    subtitle: \'Nivel 1: Detecci\303\263n Oculta Previa a la Disglicemia\',\\\\n    difficulty: \'P\\n<truncated 24048 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/data/gameLevelsData.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating gameLevelsData.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create 10 progressive clinical levels data\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":28,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:38:19Z\",\"input_tokens\":11421,\"cache_read_tokens\":124974,\"output_tokens\":3543,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing the Header**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on creating the header component. The logo and title have been specified and I\'m integrating them. The logo image URL is in hand. I\'m building this using TypeScript. I anticipate a simple and effective design.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing the Structure**\\n\\nI\'ve been analyzing the structure and content provided, focusing on the key elements like text labels (\\\"EndoMetabolic Rx\\\", etc.), the clinical mode toggle, and the patient ribbon. I\342\200\231m also considering how to represent the navigation bar elements (Fisiopatolog\303\255a, Calculadora de \303\215ndices, etc.). My next step is organizing these components logically for the UI.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { ScreenTab } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\\\n  currentTab: ScreenTab;\\\\n  onTabChange: (tab: ScreenTab) => void;\\\\n  clinicalMode: boolean;\\\\n  onToggleClinicalMode: () => void;\\\\n  currentPatientName?: string;\\n<truncated 10021 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Header.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Header.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Header component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":30,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:38:32Z\",\"input_tokens\":6795,\"cache_read_tokens\":133370,\"output_tokens\":1993,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing Sidebar Component**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m currently working on crafting the `src/components/Sidebar.tsx` file. The goal is a left-fixed sidebar, positioned with a top offset of 152px and a width of 64. I\'m focusing now on implementing the visual elements including \\\"TRIAJE Y COHORTE\\\", \\\"Estrato de Riesgo Metab\303\263lico\\\", (Estrato 2, Fricci\303\263n Moderada), and the corresponding progress bar.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { PatientLabs } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface SidebarProps {\\\\n  labs: PatientLabs;\\\\n  homaIr?: number;\\\\n  stratumName?: string;\\\\n  stratumStatus?: string;\\\\n  onOpenFhir?: () => void;\\\\n  onOpenGame?: () => void;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexp\\n<truncated 5508 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Sidebar.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Sidebar.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Sidebar component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":32,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:38:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":4755,\"cache_read_tokens\":137594,\"output_tokens\":2042,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing FHIR Modals**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on developing two key modals. First, `FhirModal.tsx` will display DiagnosticReport and Observation data as a tree structure in FHIR R4 JSON format. This modal will feature syntax highlighting for the code block, along with functionalities for copying the code, downloading the JSON, and closing the modal. Second, the `InspectorModal.tsx` is under development.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { PatientLabs } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface FhirModalProps {\\\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\\\n  onClose: () => void;\\\\n  labs: PatientLabs;\\\\n  patientName?: string;\\\\n  homaIr?: number;\\\\n  onShowToast: (msg: string) =>\\n<truncated 5836 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/FhirModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating FhirModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create FHIR DiagnosticReport modal\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":34,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:38:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":2766,\"cache_read_tokens\":141802,\"output_tokens\":1283,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\nimport { MatrixNodeDetail } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface InspectorModalProps {\\\\n  node: MatrixNodeDetail | null;\\\\n  onClose: () => void;\\\\n  onApplyProtocol: (nodeName: string) => void;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport const InspectorModal: React.\\n<truncated 3832 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/InspectorModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating InspectorModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create InspectorModal component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":36,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:39:02Z\",\"input_tokens\":4171,\"cache_read_tokens\":141768,\"output_tokens\":282,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface ToastProps {\\\\n  message: string | null;\\\\n  onClose: () => void;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport const Toast: React.FC<ToastProps> = ({ message }) => {\\\\n  if (!message) return null;\\\\n\\\\n  return (\\\\n    <div className=\\\\\\\"fixed bottom-5 ri\\n<truncated 409 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Toast.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Toast.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Toast component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":38,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:39:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":4556,\"cache_read_tokens\":141752,\"output_tokens\":11118,\"thinking\":\"**Building the Screens**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on constructing the seven main screens. So far, I\'ve got the first two screens underway: `AtmScreen.tsx` for Fisiopatolog\303\255a y ATM, and `SurrogateIndicesScreen.tsx` which will house the Calculadora de \303\215ndices Subrogados. I\'m now diving into the development of `KraftOgtt`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { MATRIX_NODES_DATA } from \'../data/patientData\';\\\\nimport { MatrixNodeDetail } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface AtmScreenProps {\\\\n  onOpenFhir: () => void;\\\\n  onOpenInspector: (node: MatrixNodeDetail) => void;\\n<truncated 39135 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/AtmScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating AtmScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Fisiopatolog\303\255a y ATM screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":40,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:39:36Z\",\"input_tokens\":11794,\"cache_read_tokens\":145802,\"output_tokens\":11507,\"thinking\":\"**Developing the Interface**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on designing the user interface for the SurrogateIndicesScreen. I\'ve started building the left panel, populating it with patient input fields for sex, fasting glucose, insulin, triglycerides, HDL, BMI, waist circumference, and GGT. A recalculate and reset button will also be included. Next up, I will work on integrating the cumulative metabolic friction gauge element.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { PatientLabs, SurrogateResults } from \'../types\';\\\\nimport { calculateSurrogates } from \'../utils/metabolicCalculators\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface SurrogateIndicesScreenProps {\\\\n  labs: PatientLabs;\\\\n  onUpdateLabs: (ne\\n<truncated 40965 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/SurrogateIndicesScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating SurrogateIndicesScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Calculadora de \303\215ndices Subrogados screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":42,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:40:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":15256,\"cache_read_tokens\":154023,\"output_tokens\":10261,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the UI Component**\\n\\nI\'m now crafting the `KraftOgttScreen.tsx` screen, aiming for parity with Image 5. The top banner will display \\\"Ensayo Diagn\303\263stico: Sobrecarga con 75g de Glucosa Anhidra \342\200\242 Matriz Temporal de 5 Puntos (0-180 min).\\\" I\'ll integrate the fasting glucose value of 9.\\n\\n\\n**Developing the Data Visualizations**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating the Kraft models into an interactive selector, with options like Din\303\241mica Normal and Hiperinsulinemia Patol\303\263gica. I am planning the design for the SVG dual-axis chart. The chart will feature morphing curves, threshold zones, AUC shading, dynamic dots, and a 5-point readout strip, allowing for detailed pancreatic kinetics visualization. The components will show data like Fase 1 and Fase 2, also Ratio de Aclaramiento and AUC of insulin, and an estimated Matsuda Index. I am also working on showing the diagnostic verdict and associated evidence.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { KRAFT_PATTERNS_MAP } from \'../utils/metabolicCalculators\';\\\\nimport { KraftPatternId } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface KraftOgttScreenProps {\\\\n  onOpenFhir: () => void;\\\\n  onShowToast: (msg: string) => void;\\n<truncated 32772 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/KraftOgttScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating KraftOgttScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Curvas Kraft OGTT screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":44,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:40:41Z\",\"input_tokens\":13300,\"cache_read_tokens\":166543,\"output_tokens\":11448,\"thinking\":\"**Developing CdssScreen Design**\\n\\nI\'m currently creating the `CdssScreen.tsx` file. The progress timeline shows that Estrato 2 is now active. I\'ve begun splitting the design into two columns, with the left column allocated seven columns. This area will house SHAP Risk Predictors using XGBoost.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing Risk and Directives**\\n\\nI\'m now integrating the Fenotipador v2.4 with its 7 key features into the right-hand column. I\'m focusing on the bi-directional SHAP Force Plot and how it informs immediate action directives related to GLUT4 and DNL, alongside biochemical countermeasures like AMPK and SIRT1 activation. Safety directives, including contraindications and clinical alerts, are also in view. Visual context is key, and I\'m adding a clinical research grid to show FHIR execution steps too.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface CdssScreenProps {\\\\n  onOpenFhir: () => void;\\\\n  onShowToast: (msg: string) => void;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport const CdssScreen: React.FC<CdssScreenProps> = ({\\\\n  onOpenFhir,\\\\n  onShowToast,\\\\n}) => {\\\\n  const [selec\\n<truncated 38442 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/CdssScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating CdssScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create CDSS y Estratificaci\303\263n screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":46,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:41:12Z\",\"input_tokens\":12545,\"cache_read_tokens\":179014,\"output_tokens\":6250,\"thinking\":\"**Developing New Screens**\\n\\nI\'ve just focused on crafting the TherapeuticsScreen, specifically the 5R Gut Restoration Protocol and its associated Posology Timeline. I\'ve also incorporated the Zone 2 Prescription and an Escalation Decision Tree. My next step will be working on additional screens.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface TherapeuticsScreenProps {\\\\n  onShowToast: (msg: string) => void;\\\\n  onOpenFhir: () => void;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport const TherapeuticsScreen: React.FC<TherapeuticsScreenProps> = ({\\\\n  onShowToast,\\\\n  onOpenFhir,\\\\\\n<truncated 21587 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/TherapeuticsScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating TherapeuticsScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Matriz Terap\303\251utica screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":48,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:41:33Z\",\"input_tokens\":6507,\"cache_read_tokens\":191451,\"output_tokens\":3949,\"thinking\":\"**Developing Monitoring Screen**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on developing the `MonitoringFhirScreen.tsx` file. I\'m implementing a continuous glucose monitoring (CGM) simulator, specifically with Dexcom and Freestyle telemetry simulation. My primary goal is to incorporate metrics such as Time in Range (TIR 70-180 mg/dL).\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface MonitoringFhirScreenProps {\\\\n  onShowToast: (msg: string) => void;\\\\n  onOpenFhir: () => void;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport const MonitoringFhirScreen: React.FC<MonitoringFhirScreenProps> = ({\\\\n  onShowToast,\\\\n  onOpen\\n<truncated 11310 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/MonitoringFhirScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating MonitoringFhirScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Monitoreo y FHIR screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":50,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:41:47Z\",\"input_tokens\":6458,\"cache_read_tokens\":195611,\"output_tokens\":5455,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the Game Screen**\\n\\nI\'m now focused on the ClinicalGameScreen, aiming for a modern and visually appealing design. The plan is to create an engaging, interactive diagnostic game with an initial set of ten levels, progressively increasing in difficulty as the game advances. I want the app to use modern colors.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { GAME_LEVELS } from \'../data/gameLevelsData\';\\\\nimport { KRAFT_PATTERNS_MAP } from \'../utils/metabolicCalculators\';\\\\nimport { GameLevel } from \'../types\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface ClinicalGameScreenProps {\\\\n  onShowToa\\n<truncated 18967 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/screens/ClinicalGameScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating ClinicalGameScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create 10-level Clinical Game screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":52,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":7938,\"cache_read_tokens\":199740,\"output_tokens\":88,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":54,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:08Z\",\"input_tokens\":4114,\"cache_read_tokens\":203886,\"output_tokens\":1848,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying App Requirements**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m working on assembling `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve started verifying its needs. I\'ve pinpointed `currentTab` as a key prop, defaulting to \'cdss-stratification\' or, more realistically, whatever the user navigated to, and making sure it handles the seven tabs. I need to make sure each tab is handled.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"/**\\\\n * @license\\\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\\\n */\\\\n\\\\nimport React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { ScreenTab, PatientLabs, MatrixNodeDetail } from \'./types\';\\\\nimport { ELEANOR_VANCE_LABS } from \'./data/patientData\';\\\\nimport { calculateSur\\n<truncated 5701 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Writing App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Implement App with all screens and state management\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":56,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":6089,\"cache_read_tokens\":203928,\"output_tokens\":49,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet to verify build\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run compile_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":58,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":6232,\"cache_read_tokens\":203916,\"output_tokens\":65,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting applet codebase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run lint_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":60,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:24Z\",\"input_tokens\":2250,\"cache_read_tokens\":208064,\"output_tokens\":1623,\"content\":\"He construido la aplicaci\303\263n **EndoMetabolic Rx** replicando con fidelidad cl\303\255nica y visual las pantallas proporcionadas e integrando el **Simulador / Desaf\303\255o Cl\303\255nico de 10 Niveles de Complejidad Progresiva**:\\n\\n### Pantallas y M\303\263dulos Implementados\\n\\n1. **Fisiopatolog\303\255a y ATM (Antecedentes, Gatillos, Mediadores):**\\n   - Perfil de paciente de **Eleanor Vance, 44a F** con trayectoria longitudinal (1980\342\200\2232024).\\n   - Marco etiol\303\263gico interactivo en 3 columnas (Antecedentes, Gatillos/Disparadores y Mediado\\n<truncated 2931 bytes>\\n PEPCK).\\n   - **Nivel 7:** Desacoplamiento Endotelial y Part\303\255culas sdLDL Densas.\\n   - **Nivel 8:** Tormenta Inflamatoria M1 y Desborde Adipocitario.\\n   - **Nivel 9:** Hiperinsulinemia Extrema y Falla de Aclaramiento (Kraft IV).\\n   - **Nivel 10:** Agotamiento de C\303\251lulas Beta y Descompensaci\303\263n Multiorg\303\241nica (Kraft V / Estrato 3 Cr\303\255tico).\\n   - Mec\303\241nicas de juego: sistema de estrellas, puntuaci\303\263n XP, multiplicador de racha combo, retroalimentaci\303\263n con fundamento fisiopatol\303\263gico y desbloqueo progresivo.\",\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Project Requirements**\\n\\nOkay, the TypeScript compilation and applet compilation are now error-free, which is great progress. I\'m currently cross-referencing this successful compilation with the user\'s initial request. I\'m focusing on ensuring all requested screens, particularly those visually reflecting the user\'s example images, like the CDSS y Estratificaci\303\263n visualizations, are accounted for.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":61,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:54Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nincorpora este logo por favor en la app.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-05T16:42:54-07:00.\\n\\nThe user has uploaded 1 image(s):\\n- image.png\\nYou can embed this image in an artifact if you need the USER to review it.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-mzf4vzryjdniowjsdw2hma-1472116662.us-east5.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-mzf4vzryjdniowjsdw2hma-1472116662.us-east5.run.app\\nUser Email: mpbombillo@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"media\":[{\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"uri\":\"image.png\"}]}\n{\"step_index\":62,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:42:57Z\",\"input_tokens\":5256,\"cache_read_tokens\":208085,\"output_tokens\":216,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking for uploaded image file\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List root directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":64,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:43:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":5637,\"cache_read_tokens\":208070,\"output_tokens\":121,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"find . -name \\\\\\\"*.png\\\\\\\" -o -name \\\\\\\"*logo*\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Finding image files in repository\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Find uploaded images\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":66,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:43:08Z\",\"input_tokens\":5860,\"cache_read_tokens\":208056,\"output_tokens\":271,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"find / -name \\\\\\\"image.png\\\\\\\" 2>/dev/null\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Searching disk for image.png\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Search disk for image.png\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":68,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:43:21Z\",\"input_tokens\":6234,\"cache_read_tokens\":208041,\"output_tokens\":605,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Logo Image**\\n\\nOkay, I\'ve got a visual here! I\'m focusing intently on this uploaded image, `image.png`, specifically its logo. I\'ve broken down the basics: a background in deep teal or forest green and a stylized graphic on the left. That graphic seems to be a regenerative tree or spine design. I\'m noting the color codes, but I\'m still trying to grasp the deeper symbolism here.\\n\\n\\n**Deconstructing the Caduceus Flame**\\n\\nI\'m now fully immersed in dissecting that caduceus flame. I\'ve pinned down the central stem as a double-curved, \\\"S\\\" shape with a beautiful golden gradient. The roots are bronze, organically curved, and the leaves at the crown are about 14-16 in an array of olive and gold tones. I\'ve also noted the exact color codes for each element. This level of detail will be crucial for the next steps!\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Header.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Header.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View current Header.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":70,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:43:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":4043,\"cache_read_tokens\":212359,\"output_tokens\":3907,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the Logo Component**\\n\\nI\'m now focused on the Functional Care logo component. I\'m building it as `src/components/FunctionalCareLogo.tsx`, ensuring it accurately renders the tree emblem with all its golden flame details, leaf crown, roots, and the \\\"FUNCTIONAL CARE\\\" \\\"MEDIC\\\" typography.\\n\\n\\n**Creating SVG Logo Variants**\\n\\nI\'m now fully immersed in the creation of the Functional Care logo\'s SVG variants. The SVG\'s are essential for scalable crispness. I\'m focusing on the detailed vector art, matching the `image.png` reference precisely. This includes the elegant \\\"S\\\"-like trunk gradient, the branching roots, the crown of alternating-hue leaves, and the typography for \\\"FUNCTIONAL CARE\\\" and \\\"MEDICINA FUNCIONAL Y REGENERATIVA\\\". I\'m making it dynamic by building a `.tsx` that will render different lockups and emblem-only, with support for custom height and dark/light backgrounds.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface FunctionalCareLogoProps {\\\\n  variant?: \'full\' | \'emblem\' | \'horizontal-badge\';\\\\n  className?: string;\\\\n  theme?: \'dark\' | \'light\' | \'colored\';\\\\n  height?: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport const FunctionalCareLogo: React.FC<Func\\n<truncated 8203 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/FunctionalCareLogo.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating FunctionalCareLogo.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create FunctionalCareLogo SVG component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":72,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:45:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":8120,\"cache_read_tokens\":212483,\"output_tokens\":247,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Header.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"25\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Header.tsx top zone\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Header brand section\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":74,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T23:46:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":5256,\"cache_read_tokens\":216618,\"output_tokens\":1358,\"thinking\":\"**Integrating the Logo**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating the FunctionalCareLogo into the Header.tsx component. I intend to display the logo with its tree emblem alongside the full \\\"FUNCTIONAL CARE - MEDICINA FUNCIONAL Y REGENERATIVA\\\" text, and include a small pill/tag element to 