    thinking: "**Designing Antigravity Scripts**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing the scripts needed for this \"antigravity\" functionality. Specifically, I\'m thinking about adding `\"export:antigravity\"` and `\"antigravity:run\"` scripts to the `package.json` file. The first will use `tsx` to run `scripts/export-antigravity-bundle.ts`, while the second will run `scripts/antigravity-runner.ts`. I believe this will lay the groundwork.\n\n\n**Defining Bundle Generation**\n\nI\'ve been figuring out the specifics of `scripts/export-antigravity-bundle.ts`. It will create `antigravity-bundle.json` with a full agent creation payload based on project files, excluding specified directories. I\'m also planning a standalone Node/TS script, `antigravity-deploy.ts`, to handle deployment using `@google/genai`. Additionally, I\'m thinking of incorporating an in-app UI modal for exporting, and will check the user\'s current UI context.\n\n\n**Adding UI Export Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating UI elements for the export functionality. I\'m adding an \"Antigravity\" button to both the header and sidebar, linked to an `AntigravityExportModal.tsx`. Inside the modal, I\'ll have tabs. One will display the configuration as JSON, providing copy/download options for `antigravity.config.json`. Another tab will bundle the sources, offering download options for `antigravity-bundle.json` and a \"copy manifest\" feature. Finally, a tab will show the executor script code.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_404485"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"/**\\n * Script de exportaci\303\263n de c\303\263digo para Antigravity Agent (Google @google/genai)\\n * Genera el paquete completo de fuentes inline para inicializar o clonar en el sandbox de Antigravity.\\n */\\nimport * as fs from \'node:fs\';\\nimport * as path from \'node:path\';\\n\\ninterface InlineSource {\\n  type: \'inline\';\\n  target: string;\\n  content: string;\\n}\\n\\nconst ROOT_DIR = process.cwd();\\n\\n// Archivos y directorios a excluir\\nconst EXCLUDE_PATHS = new Set([\\n  \'node_modules\',\\n  \'dist\',\\n  \'.git\',\\n  \'.vite\',\\n  \'bun.lock\',\\n  \'antigravity-bundle.json\',\\n]);\\n\\nfunction getAllFiles(dir: string, fileList: string[] = []): string[] {\\n  const entries = fs.readdirSync(dir, { withFileTypes: true });\\n\\n  for (const entry of entries) {\\n    const fullPath = path.join(dir, entry.name);\\n    const relPath = path.relative(ROOT_DIR, fullPath);\\n\\n    if (EXCLUDE_PATHS.has(entry.name) || Array.from(EXCLUDE_PATHS).some(ex => relPath.startsWith(ex))) {\\n      continue;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (entry.isDirectory()) {\\n      getAllFiles(fullPath, fileList);\\n    } else if (entry.isFile()) {\\n      // Filtrar archivos binarios pesados o temporales\\n      if (!entry.name.endsWith(\'.png\') && !entry.name.endsWith(\'.jpg\') && !entry.name.endsWith(\'.lock\')) {\\n        fileList.push(relPath);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return fileList;\\n}\\n\\nexport function buildAntigravityBundle() {\\n  const files = getAllFiles(ROOT_DIR);\\n  const sources: InlineSource[] = [];\\n\\n  for (const relPath of files) {\\n    try {\\n      const content = fs.readFileSync(path.join(ROOT_DIR, relPath), \'utf-8\');\\n      sources.push({\\n        type: \'inline\',\\n        target: relPath.startsWith(\'/\') ? relPath : `/${relPath}`,\\n        content,\\n      });\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.warn(`No se pudo leer ${relPath}:`, err);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const bundle = {\\n    $schema: \'https://developer.google.com/genai/schemas/antigravity-agent.json\',\\n    id: \'endometabolic-rx-functional-care\',\\n    name: \'EndoMetabolic Rx - Functional Care CDSS\',\\n    version: \'1.0.0\',\\n    description: \'Sistema de Soporte para Decisiones Cl\303\255nicas en Medicina Funcional y Diagn\303\263stico de Resistencia a la Insulina\',\\n    base_agent: \'antigravity-preview-09-2026\',\\n    metadata: {\\n      exported_at: new Date().toISOString(),\\n      file_count: sources.length,\\n      platform: \'Google GenAI Antigravity Managed Agent\',\\n    },\\n    system_instruction:\\n      \'Eres el agente cl\303\255nico e ingeniero de software responsable de EndoMetabolic Rx - Functional Care. \' +\\n      \'Tu entorno ejecuta un sandbox Linux con Node 22, React 19, Vite y Tailwind CSS v4. \' +\\n      \'Mant\303\251n siempre la compatibilidad FHIR R4, las f\303\263rmulas metab\303\263licas exactas (HOMA-IR, QUICKI, TyG, TyG-BMI, METS-IR, LAP, VAI, FLI), \' +\\n      \'el sistema de 10 niveles del desaf\303\255o cl\303\255nico y la identidad visual de Functional Care.\',\\n    base_environment: {\\n      type: \'remote\',\\n      runtime: \'node22\',\\n      workdir: \'/workspace\',\\n      ports: [3000],\\n      entrypoint: \'npm run dev\',\\n      sources,\\n    },\\n    tools: [\\n      { type: \'code_execution\' },\\n      { type: \'google_search\' },\\n      { type: \'url_context\' },\\n    ],\\n  };\\n\\n  const outputPath = path.join(ROOT_DIR, \'antigravity-bundle.json\');\\n  fs.writeFileSync(outputPath, JSON.stringify(bundle, null, 2), \'utf-8\');\\n\\n  console.log(`\342\234\205 Bundle de Antigravity exportado con \303\251xito a: ${outputPath}`);\\n  console.log(`\360\237\223\246 Archivos empaquetados: ${sources.length}`);\\n  return bundle;\\n}\\n\\nif (import.meta.url === `file://${process.argv[1]}`) {\\n  buildAntigravityBundle();\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/scripts/export-antigravity-bundle.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating export bundle script\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create export-antigravity-bundle.ts\"}"
