  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the UI Modal**\n\nI\'m starting to visualize the interactive UI modal component, `AntigravityExportModal.tsx`. My focus is on a high-tech, clinical design that\'s also modern, maintaining consistency with the Functional Care brand. I\'m thinking of the deep teal, emerald, and gold color scheme as core aesthetic elements. I plan to include the Antigravity badge.\n\n\n**Developing the Interactive Tabs**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the interactive tabs within the UI modal. I\'ve designed three tabs for the \"Google GenAI Managed Agent\" bundle. The first will display the bundle\'s JSON files in a code view with syntax highlighting, offering actions to download or copy it. The second tab will present the agent\'s configuration, with similar copy and download actions. Finally, a third tab shows the TypeScript script using the `@google/genai` API, and instructions for terminal commands. I\'m aiming for instant toast feedback.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
